<title>NEW ZEALAND: CanWest's TV3 yr profit to be up &quot;substantially&quot;.</title>
<headline>CanWest's TV3 yr profit to be up &quot;substantially&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>CanWest Global Communications CWW.TO Vice President of Operations Gerry Noble said on Wednesday that New Zealand's TV3 Network would next month report a sharp lift in earnings for the year to June.</p>
<p>&quot;I can tell you from what was reported last year that the increase this year is significant,&quot; he told Reuters.</p>
<p>TV3's net earnings came to C$9.65 million in the year to June 1995, which itself was up from C$1.78 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>&quot;This year it is up substantially from that,&quot; Noble said.</p>
</text>
